  "notes": "Admission: adults ¥320 (65+ free, 6-18 ¥100). Open 7:00-18:00 (Mar 1-Oct 15) and 8:00-17:00 (Oct 16-end Feb). Kenrokuen is a Special Place of Scenic Beauty (designated 1985). Adjacent to Kanazawa Castle Park; about 15 min by bus or 25 min on foot from Kanazawa Station.",
